WEBVTT

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.050
(STRAINING)

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.450
(PANTING)

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.610
(CHUCKLES)

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:42.770
(ALL GRUNT)

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:50.810
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.250
-(INDISTINCT CHATTERING)
-MAN: What the heck was that?

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.130
Is everybody all right?
Is anybody injured?

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.490
Are you all right?

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.530
Your story better be good.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.370
-Hey. Hey!
-(GRUNTS)

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:08.970
What happened?

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.450
(BEEPING)

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:36.290
(SIGHS)

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:38.730
(GASPS)

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:43.650
Honey, why are you...

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:46.330
Don't say anything.

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:53.130
It's Dad. Are you okay?

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:56.170
VIOLET: I'm fine.
I don't wanna talk about it.

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:57.890
Tony didn't even call?

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.970
VIOLET:
I don't wanna talk about it.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:01.410
-Oh, honey...
-VIOLET: Dad!

00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:05.330
If you want me to feel better,
then leave me alone.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:06.490
Please?

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:07.650
ROMAN: (ON TV)
See, there's nothing

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:08.890
a cop hates worse
than a missing child.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:11.810
My kid brother's son.
Today is his first birthday.

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:13.210
WOMAN: Oh, but if anybody

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.210
can find that child,
it's you, Roman.

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.050
Because you're
a wonderful policeman.

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:20.370
-ROBBER 1: This is a holdup.
-(BOB SNORING)

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:22.890
All right, get your hands up,
turn your back.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:24.130
ROBBER 2: Put your hands
behind

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.610
your heads
and keep them there!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:26.730
Don't move!

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.370
Drop that.
All right, now get over there.

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:32.490
-(OBJECTS CLATTERING)
-Watch the door.

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:33.850
ROBBER 1:
You think I'm kiddin'?

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:38.530
Now.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:40.370
(SIRENS WAILING)

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:43.450
I said now!

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:46.170
ROBBER 1: I got it! Come on,
I tell you, come on!

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:48.210
(SQUEALS)

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.650
ROBBER 2:
You wanna get killed?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.290
(STRAINS)

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.010
(GROWLS)

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.970
(GRUNTING)

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.770
(SNARLS)

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:05.770
(CHITTERING)

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:07.850
(JACK-JACK GRUNTS)

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:10.250
-(GROWLING)
-(GRUNTING)

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:16.850
(BOB SNORING)

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.570
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.490
-(GASPS)
-(JACK-JACK YELLING)

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.490
(RACCOON CHITTERING)

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.370
(JACK-JACK COUGHS)

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.010
-Uh-oh.
-(JACK-JACK GIGGLING)

00:03:58.290 --> 00:03:59.810
-(SQUEAKS)
-(JACK-JACK GIGGLING)

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.330
(YELPS)

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.050
(RACCOON GROWLS)

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.930
-(RACCOON SHRIEKING)
-(JACK-JACK COOING)

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.930
-(JACK-JACK SQUEALING)
-(CRASHING)

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.450
(GASPING)

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:23.930
(BOB GRUNTING)

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:26.850
-BOB: No, no, no!
-(JACK-JACK SNARLING)

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:28.290
(RACCOON GROWLING)

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:32.010
-No!
-(ALL COOING)

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.690
BOB: No, no, no.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.690
No, no, no.

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:39.890
-No, no, no!
-(SNARLING)

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.410
(RACCOON GROWLING)

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.610
(SHOUTING GIBBERISH)

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:47.810
(GIGGLING)

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:51.130
You have powers!

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:52.850
Yeah, baby,

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.890
and there's not
a scratch on you!

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:56.530
Did you go through
the locked door?

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.730
Are those your powers?
(CHUCKLES)

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.090
Who can multiply like rabbits

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.250
and go right through
any solid...

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.330
-(SNEEZES)
-(YELPS)

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:10.490
-Oh, my God!
-(GIGGLING)

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.770
(PHONE RINGING)

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:17.170
-Hello?
-HELEN: Hey, honey.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.090
-You weren't gonna call me?
-BOB: Oh, hey!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.290
(STAMMERING)
No. I mean, yes, yeah...

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.650
-I just didn't wanna wake you.
-(JACK-JACK BABBLING)

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:26.530
The strangest thing
just happened out in the yard.

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:27.810
Sounds like I just
woke you up.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:28.930
No, no.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.770
-It's just, Jack-Jack...
-He had an accident!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.170
I knew it!

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.730
I'm coming home right now!
I never should have...

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.330
No accident. Stay there
and finish your mission.

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:37.850
You never should...

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:39.970
What?
You don't think I can do this?

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:42.530
No, no.
Sorry. I misspoke.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:43.930
Do you need me to come back?

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.890
No, no. No, I've got this.
Everything's great.

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.450
What happened with Jack-Jack?

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:52.130
Nothing.
He's in excellent health.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.370
-Well, that's good.
-(VIOLET SOBBING)

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.490
-How was Violet's date?
-BOB: Uh...

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.450
HELEN:
That was tonight, right?

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:01.090
BOB: (STAMMERING) Yes. Good.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.370
All fine and good.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.290
And Jack-Jack went down
with no trouble?

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:06.930
-(JACK-JACK COOING)
-Fine, yes, no trouble.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.690
And Dash got his
homework done?

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.130
BOB: All done.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.290
So, things haven't
spiraled out

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:12.410
of control the moment I left?

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.410
Amazing as it may seem,

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.850
it has been
quite uneventful in fact.

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:18.490
How about you?

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:21.290
I saved a runaway train!
(LAUGHING IN DELIGHT)

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.530
It was so great!

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.450
The mayor was there to cut
the ribbon on this new train.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.930
REPORTER 1:
Elastigirl pursued the train

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:31.090
and was able
to successfully activate...

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.330
Blah, blah, blah. He says a
few words, cuts the ribbon...

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:34.610
and the train starts pulling

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:36.090
out of the station
backwards...

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.970
REPORTER 2: ...track of its
brand new hovertrain...

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.530
...malfunctioned...

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:40.770
...thanking Elastigirl...

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.410
REPORTER 3:
Superhero Elastigirl...

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:44.530
REPORTER 4: Elastigirl...

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:48.050
Boom! No casualties!
(SQUEALS)

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.490
REPORTER 5:
...specialized motorbike,

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:50.730
saving all of the
passengers...

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.010
HELEN:
One thing leads to another

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.090
and suddenly, I go after it!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.410
I'm telling you, honey,
it was a saga!

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.370
That's fantastic, honey!

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.650
And on your first night!

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.730
I am so proud of you, really.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.370
I'm proud of you, honey.

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:07.050
I know you want to get out
there and you will soon.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:09.010
And you'll be amazing.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:10.290
I couldn't have done this

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:11.730
if you hadn't
taken over so well.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:13.530
Thanks for handling
everything.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.130
It's nothing.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:18.330
(SIGHS) I love you, honey.
I'll be back soon.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:21.170
-Sweet dreams.
-Sweet dreams, honey.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:23.410
(SIGHS)

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:25.930
(SNORING)

